# Production environment (committed to git)
#
# Used by: npm run build, GitHub Actions deploy (checkout + build).
# All VITE_* vars here are public client config — baked into the JS bundle.
# Do NOT duplicate these in deploy.yml or GitHub Secrets.
#
# GitHub Secrets are only for private deploy credentials (AWS keys).
# Server-only secrets (e.g. TURNSTILE_SECRET_KEY) belong in the backend, not here.
#
# Local dev overrides live in .env.development (gitignored), not this file.
